        "notes": "Billy the Hero focuses on relationship dynamics among characters, featuring romantic themes throughout the gameplay. While the game does include some sexy imagery, it does not present explicit nudity or graphic sexual content. Any suggestive visuals are tasteful and ensure no breasts or genitalia are shown.\r\n\r\nIn terms of violence, players will encounter instances where Billy may die in dramatic ways, such as being impaled by spikes from traps, which may depict graphic imagery of the character\u2019s body being pierced. However, it\u2019s important to note that the game does not involve drug use; Billy does not engage in substance abuse.\r\n\r\nWe advise potential players to consider their comfort levels with these themes before engaging with the game."
